From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?John=20T=C3=B6rnblom?= <john.tornblom@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:55:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ps4: SDL2main, which sets up the XDG directories and exits
 cleanly

The XDG base directories are no longer set by the SDK's crt, as they do
not apply to every kind of program. SDL2main sets them up before main():

- in /temp0, the title's temporary data, when libSceAppContent can mount
  it (only for a game application);
- otherwise in common_temp, in the sandbox, or in /user/temp/common_temp
  outside it.

When the program is finished, SDL2main exits back to the home screen with
sceSystemServiceLoadExec("exit", NULL).

SDL now always links libSceAppContent, which SDL2main calls, and
orbis-pkg-config adds -lSDL2main. SDL_MAIN_HANDLED skips all of this.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EVpxQhSVskRCNVLPwL6rJM
